rform actions \u2014 find matching pairs or pairs that add up to 10. Every valid pair lets you attack, heal, defend, or trigger powerful special effects.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A variety of unique foes to face</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708620/extras/ae33108ef301130aed0cbcca3bbd378e.poster.avif?t=1774131670\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708620/extras/ae33108ef301130aed0cbcca3bbd378e.webm?t=1774131670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708620/extras/ae33108ef301130aed0cbcca3bbd378e.mp4?t=1774131670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies shape the battlefield as much as you do! Each one demands thoughtful tactics and a fresh approach to win. Get ready for true duels against the most cunning villains!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter-based structure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more losing all your progress in a single long run \u2014 this roguelite takes a different path! The game is divided into chapters, each with its own unique theme. One chapter pits you against goblins, the next throws you into battle with the undead, and later \u2014 with deadly mages. With each chapter, enemies grow stronger and offer new kinds of challenges. And your progress is saved between chapters!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708620/extras/94e0e990bb763d08fa0bc11a4a34e911.poster.avif?t=1774131670\" width=1170 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i